{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/18058-starting-up-your-own-hell","id":18058,"title":"Starting up your own Hell","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-25T18:01:34-08:00","id":18058,"title":"Starting up your own Hell","content":"So Demons for the most part want to achieve Hell. Some Demons believe that Hell can be another world. Demon can access other realms of existence.... soooo it seems a perfectly reasonable that a subject of finding your own Hell would be a good goal for a Chronicle. Build enough of a power base/ resources in the normal world, survive the Godmachine and slowly build up for Carving your own Hell, particularly if your Demon Ring can agree on sharing a Hell.<br /> <br /> So what would be your preferred location for Hell?<br /> The big issues:<ul><li>You need Aether so you need to establish stable Aether supply lines, or you could just go deep enough where you can manufacture your own Aether by going Demonic, and I'd wager if making your own hell is the goal of the Chronicle then your cipher may point to it, and you might learn to channel another fuel besides Aether.</li> <li>How safe are you in other realms from Angels? I would guess the Astral may be probably in the most vulnerable end of the spectrum, but places such as the Hedge, The Underworld, and the Lower Depths are probably more along the more defensible lines where it becomes more trouble then its worth to chase you down for the God Machine.</li> <li>Then you have truly more unique options, such as a Golden Road, or some sort of Null Space like the Boltholes or bubble realms built by mages.</li> <li>What about surveying other Worlds, possibly already inhabited by the Godmachine, such as Prince of 100,000 Leaves and other alternate timelines.</li> <li>What connections would you make with natives or others who have a strong connection to the realms, like Mages in the Astral, or Werewolves in the Shadow, or even Hobgoblins in the Hedge.</li> <li>What are some interesting methods of gathering Minions? I'd imagine with the right embeds you could recruit/import/fabricate your own minions of hell. And with proper contracts you could probably even customize your own denizens qualities, like is there anything stopping you from giving a Hobgoblin a human wife with a pact? Or start collecting years of experience as security guards or teachers to hand out.</li> </ul><br /> So how much of the chronicle would you spend on exploring which dimension to make your Hell, and would you possibly abandon one option for another through action in a story arc like you move from the Shadow cause some God placed a bounty on your head, while at the same time you know of a void in a certain Dead Dominion due to the fall of a Kerberos?<br /> <br /> What would your personal favorite choice be for staking out a Hell someplace?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T18:28:36-08:00","id":18068,"title":"","content":"Golden Roads are nearly inaccessible, but if an Archmage dies, her Golden Road still exists and its irises to other realms still exist. These dead roads are sometimes known as Wendings. Maybe a personal hell could be a captured Wending filled discarded minions, subverted infrastructure, and gates to boltholes and other realms.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: the Ascension - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1191028-redesigned-prime-sphere\" target=\"_blank\">Redesigned Prime Sphere</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1188769-simpler-wonder-creation\" target=\"_blank\">Streamlined Wonder Creation</a><br /> Mummy: the Curse - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/474927-mummy-the-curse-2e-conversion\" target=\"_blank\">Lightweight 2E Conversion</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/22378-second-sight-tradition-disciples-of-duat\" target=\"_blank\">Disciples of Duat</a>","edited":{"userid":61,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","user":"Octavo","date":". 11-25-2013, 09:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","name":"Octavo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar61_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T18:38:10-08:00","id":18075,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Octavo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/18058-starting-up-your-own-hell?p=18068#post18068\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Golden Roads are nearly inaccessible, but if an Archmage dies, her Golden Road still exists and its irises to other realms still exist. These dead roads are sometimes known as Wendings. Maybe a personal hell could be a captured Wending filled with subverted infrastructure and gates to boltholes and other realms.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well that is why I had Golden Roads as one of the options, its a pretty ideal situation.<br /> <br /> Rival Demon Rings could even have established one as their own Hell, the Seers even have those ones with Chantries that start becoming communal worlds.<br /> <br /> If you use the Traitors Agenda that Raven made then an Archmage as a Patron would be a viable option, and he may already have a Golden Road much like a Heaven or Hell, or you could help build onto it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T22:25:46-08:00","id":18187,"title":"","content":"The actual, factual Robot Hell is in New Jersey. Just ask Bender.<br /> <br /> (sorry, couldn't resist)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","name":"squidheadjax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1096_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T22:28:16-08:00","id":18189,"title":"","content":"Oh my God that's actually Pertinent! Yeah what about if the Demons that founded it aren't just a bunch of selfish Jags and want to serve a purpose so they found this Hell to serve as a place of punishment and purification?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T22:39:03-08:00","id":18190,"title":"","content":"*scratches chin* Holy crap, I was serious!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","name":"squidheadjax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1096_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T23:55:40-08:00","id":18228,"title":"","content":"Ideally, you would find a way to create your own splinter. Tear one open, hop in, slowly infiltrate the Infrastructure that exists at the time, and eventually, you'll have a ton of Aether and no way for the God-Machine to surprise you, so long as you keep the entrance(s) to the splinter a secret. Alternatively, you could try to do the same thing with an existing splinter, the way Mother Damnable has done in the 1889 splinter. <br /> <br /> Doing this alone would be exceptionally difficult; you'd either need to be an immensely powerful, patient Demon, or the help of an invested Agency. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}